tome book~
This tome is the Holy Wisdom Book of Jamn.  In the opening pages are the
principle tenants of the Sacred One.
  1. Good and Evil are but transient forces that will dissolve into one.
     Therefore, take no heed of one nor the other but maintain a balance
     within your soul.
  2. Sentient life is of essential value.  Harm no one through your deeds,
     whether it be by sword or by theft.  Many animals and soulless 
     humanoids wander throughout the Dominion.  These may be used as you
     see fit, for they have no hope of being awakened.  All those who
     have souls and sentience stand sacred in the eyes of Jamn and may
      not be harmed.
  3. Love.

~
